S = {'cc': 'NI', 'fam': 'Social', 'doc': '# Nicaragua 2025: employer INSS contributions, Régimen Integral (2200)\n\nSource: Decreto Presidencial N° 06-2019 (31 Jan 2019, La Gaceta N° 21 of 1 Feb 2019), reforming Decreto 975\n(Reglamento General de la Ley de Seguridad Social); copy on leybook.com (doc 22702, fetched 2026-11-21,\n`ni/law/decreto_06_2019_leybook22702.pdf`). **Art. 11 (2)**, Régimen Integral, from 1 February 2019: IVM "A cargo del\nempleador: 13.50%, para los empleadores que tengan 50 trabajadores o más; 12.50%, para los empleadores que tengan menos\nde 50 trabajadores"; Riesgos Profesionales "A cargo del empleador: 1.50%"; Víctimas de Guerra "A cargo del empleador:\n1.50%"; Enfermedad y Maternidad "A cargo del Empleador 6.00%". Total 22.5 % (50 workers or more) or 21.5 %.\n**Art. 16**: "A partir del 1 de Febrero de 2019 no existirá límite máximo para la remuneración" (no ceiling).\nCompanies: by `employees` (50 or more: 22.5 %; a company without a head count is taken as below 50). Households:\nemployer size unknown, 21.5 % (flagged). Grade B (secondary host of the Gazette text). \n\nPass 6: **INATEC** (3000), Ley Orgánica del Instituto Nacional Tecnológico, Decreto 40-94 (La Gaceta 192 of 14 Oct 1994;\nJustia Nicaragua copy `ni/law/inatec_decreto_40-94_justia.html`) **art. 24 a)**: "El aporte mensual obligatorio del 2%\nsobre el monto total de las planillas de sueldos brutos, o fijos a cargo de todos los empleadores de la República";\n**art. 25**: collected by the social security institute with its own contributions. The 2009 reform (Decreto of 6 Aug\n2009, also held) changes art. 11 only. Applied at 2 % of the whole wage, no ceiling. Grade A (text read on a\nsecondary host of the decree).', 'lean': 'def rateBp (big : Bool) : Int := if big then 2250 else 2150\ndef inss (big : Bool) : Contribution := { name := "INSS Régimen Integral (empleador)", sched := Schedule.flat (rateBp big) }\ndef inssStatute : String := "Decreto 975 art. 11 (2) as reformed by Decreto 06-2019: IVM 13.5 % (50+ workers) / 12.5 %, RP 1.5 %, VG 1.5 %, EM 6 %; art. 16 no ceiling"\ndef sscF : Family :=\n  { name := "2200 INSS employer (Régimen Integral)", covers := [.sscEmployer],\n    run := fun _ g _ =>\n      if g.entity == .company then\n        [charge .sscEmployer "INSS Régimen Integral (empleador)" g.company.payroll id\n          (fun _ => payrollAmount (fun w => (inss (decide (50 ≤ g.company.employees))).amount w) g.company)\n          (event := "payroll") (level := .social) (bearer := .entity) (statute := inssStatute)]\n      else\n        (g.household.adults.zipIdx.filter fun (a, _) => a.wages > 0).map fun (a, i) =>\n          charge .sscEmployer "INSS Régimen Integral (empleador)" a.wages id (fun b => (inss false).amount b)\n            (event := s!"adult {i + 1}") (level := .social) (bearer := .employer) (statute := inssStatute) }\ndef inatec : Contribution := { name := "INATEC aporte mensual (2 %)", sched := Schedule.flat 200 }\ndef inatecF : Family := employerFamily "3000 INATEC 2 %" [inatec] "Decreto 40-94 (Ley Orgánica del INATEC) arts. 24 a), 25: 2 % of gross payroll, all employers" (inBp := 10000) (oecd := .payroll) (level := .central)', 'families': '[sscF, inatecF]', 'unsupported': [['g.household.adults.any (·.wages > 0)', 'INSS employer 21.5 % (employer with fewer than 50 workers assumed; 22.5 % from 50)'], ['g.entity == .company', 'INSS employer by head count (no head count: below 50)']], 'guards': ['(inss true).amount 1000000 == 225000', '(inss false).amount 1000000 == 215000', 'inatec.amount 1000000 == 20000'], 'taxes': [{'oecd': '2200', 'tax': 'INSS Régimen Integral (employer)', 'statute': 'Decreto 975 arts. 11 (2), 16 as reformed by Decreto Presidencial 06-2019', 'dated': 'La Gaceta N° 21 of 1 Feb 2019 (leybook copy)', 'grade': 'B', 'package': 'P4', 'kernel_parts': ['charge', 'Contribution'], 'unsupported': ['household employer size unknown (21.5 %)']}, {'oecd': '3000', 'tax': 'INATEC aporte mensual (2 %)', 'statute': 'Decreto 40-94 (Ley Orgánica del INATEC) arts. 24 a), 25 (reform of 2009: art. 11 only)', 'dated': 'Decreto 40-94, La Gaceta 192 of 14 Oct 1994 (Justia copy)', 'grade': 'A', 'package': 'P4', 'kernel_parts': ['employerFamily', 'Contribution']}]}
